'''Rugby Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]] who can be unlocked when beating the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Dogsville (Merciless)|Wanwan's Glory]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]] increases health and damage, and gains [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immunity]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] targeting.

